%% Karma core settlement loop — export via https://mermaid.live
flowchart LR
  A[双方 lock USDC] --> B[铸造 Bill Token 1:1]
  B --> C[bind 绑定交易对]
  C --> D[交付 + 证据 proofHash]
  D --> E[settle 进入 FINALIZING]
  E --> F{争议窗内争议?}
  F -->|否| G[finalizeSettle]
  G --> H[Burn Bills · 释放 USDC · SETTLED]
  F -->|是| I[DISPUTED]
  I --> J[resolveDispute / 仲裁]
  J --> H
  C --> K[超时未结算]
  K --> L[refundOnTimeout]
  L --> M[退回各自锁定]
